      "statement": "normalizeConceptContent delegates to repairOkfFrontmatter, which leaves a page byte-for-byte unchanged when its frontmatter parses and validates. For parseable-but-invalid YAML it edits only the offending recognized field through line-preserving setters; for unparseable or still-invalid YAML it falls back to a minimal block (type, title, and `openwiki_generated: true` via OPENWIKI_GENERATED_FIELD) emitted by renderFrontmatter.",
